# resources/ holds files embedded into the Wails app at build time.
#
# Build artefacts (not checked in — see .gitignore):
#   em-walld                          — built by `make daemon`
#   com.em-wall.daemon.plist          — copied from launchd/ by `make app-resources`
#   em-wall.pf.anchor                 — stub written by `make app-resources`
#
# Vendored xray-core release (CHECKED IN, replace + bump version constant
# to upgrade — see core/xray/version.go):
#   xray                              — Xray-macos-arm64-v8a (v26.3.27)
#   geoip.dat, geosite.dat            — Xray-core routing data
#   xray-LICENSE                      — MPL-2.0, kept alongside the binary
